OL,3,GNEWSALeaving your engine running in
OL,4,AWales could cost you #150
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in Wales who leave their
OL,7,Fvehicle engine running while parked
OL,8,Fwill face fines of up to #150 from
OL,9,FWednesday.
OL,11,FThe change is part of a new measure by
OL,12,Fthe Welsh government to try to reduce
OL,13,Fharmful pollution and to protect
OL,14,Fchildren's health.
OL,16,FThe previous punishment for idling, as
OL,17,Fit is known, was #20, but that has now
OL,18,Fbeen raised to anywhere from #75 to
OL,19,F#150, depending on circumstances.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
